// title: Threat Hunting Mshta with Sentinel TI
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceFileEvents, DeviceNetworkEvents, EmailUrlInfo, ThreatIntelIndicators
// purpose: Threat Hunting Mshta with Sentinel TI
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Sentinel/Threat%20Hunting%20Mshta%20with%20Sentinel%20TI.kql
// kind: repo
// author: Steven Lim
